00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.377
the different perspectives.

00:04:26.377 --> 00:04:27.460
AARTHI RAMAMURTHY: Gotcha.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.644
Very similar here.

00:04:28.644 --> 00:04:30.310
So my name is Aarthi
