00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.520
to start thinking
about it as how

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:09.060
do you cater to a totally
different audience,

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.410
different scale of
audience, and also

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:14.120
deal with building your
